omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I7ZVvqQNFxcQ7kNvwHufkU4&_nc_oc=AdoqKH9_geouVmiwZL2rfsE6s5foRvbxxQO1xTw27S8dRboLGWHVmM6RYU7Igjyi6eY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBYZUPdgoAmjcWBvzxPZfLD6ivEy_B8y0De9ZHkZa2QPQ&oe=6A6777B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vs7vQoO4dIkQ7kNvwEPK0FJ&_nc_oc=AdrVXPlr5_N5PBw7MckmvknYxDoHz0C-S-L8ysK9FBKGR-4I00G-VCwRaCFKRGQTQLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCzOXt8IJb0RSGf6pC6SCniZ7TMmjVMPO51E0SRiuApgg&oe=6A6740D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wv3srWXHhDAQ7kNvwFO73Ib&_nc_oc=AdpLiYY5D2vKF7AG_bbPYaLZryWg2MajL5O_tfuCWvMq1440rK-AlpUBsW5ZsWrm8cA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD1nWeSmUJCAbMAdzWiFcxlgCv0rEKrTzB4GvgxPod7aw&oe=6A6755F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://